# Vendored upstream checkouts (see .gitmodules for pinned commits/URLs).
# third_party/PEEK is a real, pinned git submodule and is tracked.
# ultralytics/yolov5 are not wired as real submodules in this working
# copy, so ignore their working files rather than committing 40MB+ of
# unpinned upstream code.
third_party/*/
!third_party/PEEK
